  "name": "Ignite (Wildfire Sorcerer)",
  "type": "feature",
  "system": {
    "attribution": {},
    "description": "<p>When a PC marks HP from the Sorcerer’s damage, you can <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to light the target <em>On Fire</em> until they are doused or put out the fire with a successful Finesse roll. When a creature acts while <em>On Fire</em> they must take an extra <strong>3d8</strong> direct magical damage if they are still <em>On Fire</em> at the end of their action.</p>",
